Agent GovBench: vendored copy of Google's Agent Gateway codelab

This directory contains a modified copy of demos/agent-gateway from
https://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/cloud-networking-solutions
(upstream commit 7eb7691c4cd7da53323a4f7cee65dc70de24b295), Copyright 2026 Google LLC,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE in this directory).

Modifications Copyright 2026 brej-29, also under the Apache License, Version 2.0:
- changes for a Google Cloud project without an organization (marked GOVBENCH-NOORG);
- resource labels, agent sizing overrides, a CA-bundle workaround, an optional TLS diagnostic and
  reserved demo email domains (marked GOVBENCH, GOVBENCH-COST, GOVBENCH-CA, GOVBENCH diagnostic).
Every modified upstream file carries these markers; the full list is in GOVBENCH_CHANGES.md. Added files:
GOVBENCH_CHANGES.md, UPSTREAM_COMMIT.txt, NOTICE, LICENSE (copy of the upstream repository's license),
src/mortgage-agent/agent/_govbench_diag.py and terraform/.terraform.lock.hcl (generated by terraform init).
All other files are unchanged from upstream.
